{'symbol': 'CB', 'date': '2022-05-19 16:15:00', 'title': 'CHUBB LIMITED SHAREHOLDERS APPROVE 29TH CONSECUTIVE ANNUAL DIVIDEND INCREASE; CHUBB LIMITED BOARD DECLARES RECORD DATE FOR FIRST DIVIDEND INSTALLMENT AND AUTHORIZES NEW SHARE REPURCHASE PROGRAM', 'text': "ZURICH , MAY 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CHUBB LIMITED (NYSE: CB) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT AT ITS 2022 ANNUAL GENERAL MEETING, HELD AT THE COMPANY'S OFFICES IN ZURICH, SWITZERLAND, SHAREHOLDERS APPROVED A 3.75% INCREASE IN THE COMPANY'S DIVIDEND TO $3.32 PER SHARE ANNUALLY ($0.83 PER SHARE, PER QUARTER) FROM $3.20 PER SHARE ($0.80 PER SHARE, PER QUARTER). THIS MARKS THE TWENTY-NINTH CONSECUTIVE ANNUAL INCREASE IN THE COMPANY'S DIVIDEND."}